### Get Reproductive Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/reproductive-status

### Update Reproductive Status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/reproductive-status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isPregnant": false,
  "lastPeriodDate": "2025-10-01",
  "averageCycleLength": 28,
  "averagePeriodDuration": 5
}

### Get Period Tracker Data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/period-tracker

### Create Period Log
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/period-logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lastPeriodDate": "2025-10-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "mood": "Normal",
  "notes": "Regular period with mild cramps",
  "averagePeriodDuration": 5
}

### Get All Period Logs for User
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/period-logs

### Get Specific Period Log
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/period-logs/1

### Update Period Log
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/period-logs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mood": "Tired",
  "notes": "Updated notes: More tired than usual",
  "averagePeriodDuration": 6
}

### Delete Period Log
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/period-logs/1

### Create Pregnancy Planning
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/pregnancy-planning
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lastPeriodDate": "2025-10-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "cycleLength": 28,
  "lifestyleGoals": "Exercise regularly and eat healthy",
  "notes": "Planning to start trying next month"
}

### Get Pregnancy Planning
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/pregnancy-planning

### Update Pregnancy Planning
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/pregnancy-planning
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cycleLength": 30,
  "lifestyleGoals": "Updated goals: Focus on nutrition and stress management"
}

### Delete Pregnancy Planning
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/pregnancy-planning
